### Orvexa API v1 — journey step 11: cases, notes, link
### Open a case (serialized per-tenant ref), add a note, link the interaction,
### walk the guarded lifecycle (open → in_progress → pending_customer →
### resolved → closed; reopen legal from resolved; closed is terminal).

@ORVEXA_URL = {{$processEnv ORVEXA_URL}}
@ORVEXA_KEY = {{$processEnv ORVEXA_KEY}}

### Open a case → 201 (priority ∈ low|normal|high|urgent, default normal)
# @name openCase
POST {{ORVEXA_URL}}/api/v1/cases
X-API-Key: {{ORVEXA_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "{{createCustomer.response.body.$.data.id}}",
  "subject": "Billing dispute",
  "description": "Customer disputes the March invoice total",
  "priority": "normal"
}

###

### Add a note → 201 (author_type ∈ agent|ai_agent|system; body ≤ 8000)
# @name addCaseNote
POST {{ORVEXA_URL}}/api/v1/cases/{{openCase.response.body.$.data.id}}/notes
X-API-Key: {{ORVEXA_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author_type": "agent",
  "author_id": "{{registerAgent.response.body.$.data.id}}",
  "body": "Checked with the billing team — invoice is being corrected.",
  "internal": true
}

###

### List notes → 200
# @name listCaseNotes
GET {{ORVEXA_URL}}/api/v1/cases/{{openCase.response.body.$.data.id}}/notes
X-API-Key: {{ORVEXA_KEY}}

###

### Link the chat interaction to the case → 204 No Content
# (swap {{createInteraction...$.data.ID}} for the voice call ID to link that)
# @name linkInteraction
POST {{ORVEXA_URL}}/api/v1/cases/{{openCase.response.body.$.data.id}}/interactions/{{createInteraction.response.body.$.data.ID}}/link
X-API-Key: {{ORVEXA_KEY}}

###

### Transition: open → in_progress → 200
# to ∈ open|in_progress|pending_customer|resolved|closed|canceled
# (illegal → 409; reopen legal from resolved)
# @name transitionCase
POST {{ORVEXA_URL}}/api/v1/cases/{{openCase.response.body.$.data.id}}/transition
X-API-Key: {{ORVEXA_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "in_progress",
  "reason": "investigating"
}

###

### Get the case → 200
# @name getCase
GET {{ORVEXA_URL}}/api/v1/cases/{{openCase.response.body.$.data.id}}
X-API-Key: {{ORVEXA_KEY}}

###

### List cases → 200
# @name listCases
GET {{ORVEXA_URL}}/api/v1/cases
X-API-Key: {{ORVEXA_KEY}}
